      "category": "",
      "publishedDate": "",
      "intro": "Staff Selection Commission (SSC) has Officially Released Final Result with Marks for The Post of GD Constable (CAPFs) in Various Department Recruitment 2024. Wait is Over, SSC has Released Final Result. All Registered Candidates Can Download Final Result with Marks Now in The Given Link Below.",
